---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Uses"
  description="日常使用的工具与装备。"
>
  <section>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Uses</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted">日常使用的工具与装备。</p>

    <div class="prose prose-stone mt-10 max-w-none prose-a:text-accent">
      <h2>editor / 编辑器</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.cursor.com/">Cursor</a>
          and
          <a href="https://codeium.com/windsurf">Windsurf</a>
          with minimal settings
        </li>
        <li>
          Font:
          <a href="https://www.nerdfonts.com/font-downloads">MesloLGL Nerd Font</a>,
          <a href="https://philpl.gumroad.com/l/dank-mono">Dank Mono</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/abeixiaolu/xiaoluabei-vscode-theme">
            Theme: Xiaolu Abei
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Icons:
          <a
            href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=Yummygum.city-lights-icon-vsc"
          >
            City Lights
          </a>
          and
          <a
            href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=antfu.icons-carbon"
          >
            Carbon Icons
          </a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>shell / 命令行</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://ghostty.org/">Ghostty</a>
          running with
          <a href="https://starship.rs/">Starship prompt</a>
          on zsh.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.nerdfonts.com/font-downloads">
            Font: Berkeley Mono
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/abeixiaolu/xiaoluabei-vscode-theme">
            Theme: Xiaolu Abei
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Terminal Tools:
          <a href="https://github.com/ajeetdsouza/zoxide">zoxide</a>,
          <a href="https://github.com/zsh-users/zsh-autosuggestions">
            zsh-autosuggestions
          </a>,
          <a href="https://github.com/zsh-users/zsh-syntax-highlighting">
            zsh-syntax-highlighting
          </a>,
          <a href="https://github.com/Schniz/fnm">fnm</a>,
          <a href="https://github.com/sharkdp/bat">bat</a>,
          <a href="https://github.com/eza-community/eza">eza</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>apps / 桌面应用</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.raycast.com/">Raycast</a>
          for everything.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://zen-browser.app/">Zen Browser</a>: but still use
          <a href="https://www.google.com/chrome/">Google Chrome</a>
          as developer tools.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/jordanbaird/Ice">Ice</a>: menubar manager.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://logseq.com/">Logseq</a>
          for knowledge management.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.mowglii.com/itsycal/">Itsycal</a>: menubar
          calendar.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://iina.io/">IINA</a>: media player.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://freemacsoft.net/appcleaner/">AppCleaner</a>:
          uninstaller.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://karabiner-elements.pqrs.org/">Karabiner</a>: keyboard
          manager, use caps lock as hyper key.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>hardware / 硬件</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Computer: MacBook Pro 14" M1 Pro 16GB</li>
        <li>Phone: iPhone 15 Pro 256GB</li>
        <li>AirPods: AirPods 4</li>
        <li>Camera: Panasonic Lumix S5M2X, Sony ZV-1</li>
        <li>
          Lens: Panasonic 50mm f/1.8, Panasonic 70-300mm f/4.5-5.6, Sigma
          28-70mm f/2.8-4
        </li>
        <li>Monitor: INNOCN 27" 4K 144Hz</li>
        <li>Keyboard: Nuphy Halo 75</li>
        <li>Mouse: Logitech MX Master 2s</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
